---
import { TextSection } from '@littlesticks/odyssey-theme-components';
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import HeroSection from '../components/sections/heros/HeroSection.astro';
import { Button } from '@littlesticks/odyssey-theme-components';
import {Icon} from 'astro-icon';

const seo = {
	title: 'About | SCV Pet Care',
	description: 'About Page',
};
---

<Layout {seo}>
	<HeroSection>
		<div slot="text-container">
			<h1>About Jaimie Garber</h1>
			<p>
				Santa Clarita native Jaimie Garber, certified by the Council for Professional Dog Trainers, passionately provides comprehensive pet care, specializing in strengthening the bond between pets and owners. She cherishes her roles as a professional, wife, and mother.
			</p>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;"> 

        <Button href="mailto:scvpetcare@gmail.com" customIcon>scvpetcare@gmail.com<Fragment slot="icon">
      
          <Button  href="tel:6617143945" customIcon>Call
          <Fragment slot="icon">
            <Icon name="ic:baseline-chevron-right"/>
          </Fragment></Button>
      </div>
		</div>
    <picture slot="image-container">
      <img
        src="../assets/images/aboutjaimie.jpg"
        alt="Jaimie Garber" 
        id="home-hero-image"
      />
    </picture>
	</HeroSection>
  <TextSection narrow>
    <p>Born and raised in Santa Clarita, I've dedicated my life to serving our local animal community. My journey in animal care began in 2004 at a local veterinary office, where I gained invaluable hands-on experience.</p>

    <p>Pursuing further education, I enrolled in Moorpark College's prestigious Exotic Animal Training and Management (E.A.T.M.) program. This rigorous curriculum provided comprehensive understanding of animal behavior and training techniques across various species. I proudly earned Associate in Science degrees in both Animal Training and Animal Behavior, equipping me with a strong theoretical foundation to complement my practical experience.</p>
    
    <p>To further enhance my expertise, particularly in canine behavior, I undertook the challenging process of certification with the Certification Council for Professional Dog Trainers (CCPDT). This internationally recognized certification demands extensive knowledge and hands-on experience, ensuring that certified trainers meet the highest standards in the field. Achieving this certification underscores my commitment to providing top-tier, scientifically-based training services to our community's dogs and their owners.</p>
    
    <p>My greatest satisfaction comes from transforming relationships between owners and their pets. Watching these bonds grow into lifelong friendships is truly rewarding.</p>
    
    <p>Outside of work, I'm happily married to my supportive husband, Justin Garber, and we're proud parents of two wonderful children. Balancing my roles as a professional, wife, and mother is challenging but immensely fulfilling.</p>
    
    <p>Every day, I look forward to making a difference in the lives of animals and their owners while cherishing moments with my family. This commitment to both my community and loved ones forms the heart of who I am and what I do.</p>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;">
    </div>
</TextSection>

      <Button href="mailto:scvpetcare@gmail.com" customIcon>scvpetcare@gmail.com<Fragment slot="icon">
    
        <Button  href="tel:6617143945" customIcon>Call
        <Fragment slot="icon">
          <Icon name="ic:baseline-chevron-right"/>
        </Fragment></Button>
    </div>
  </TextSection>
</Layout>
